      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "However, if there are any problems with the shipment, communicate them accordingly."
      ],
      "justification": "The negative guard and subsequent action node accurately reflect the failure path and required communication."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:n11->n12",
        "action:n12"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After checking the shipment status again, if it is okay,"
