    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:n11->n13",
        "action:n13"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Otherwise, communicate any shipment problems."
      ],
      "justification": "The negative guard and action node correctly implement the fallback communication step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "end:e1"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Finally, once the payment is sent, the process comes to an end."
      ],
      "justification": "The closing sentence explicitly signals process termination, which maps to the structural end node."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b1->n6",
        "guard:b1->c1",
        "action:n6"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "In case there were any shipment problems, make sure to communicate them before proceeding to Ship Material."
      ],
      "justification": "The conditional branch, guards, communication action, and converge node collectively model the prerequisite check and handling loop positioned correctly before the shipping step."
    }
